OL,3,GNEWSATeen charged over Halloween
OL,4,Astabbings refused bail
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother 16-year-old boy from
OL,7,FSouthampton has been charged with
OL,8,Fattempted murder. A provisional trial
OL,9,Fdate for both defendants has been set
OL,10,Ffor 4 May 2027.
